      "jcr:created": "Sat Jan 11 2025 13:52:40 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><i><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">2-minute read</span></i></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">We’re proud to announce that our Xpedition powered stair chair has earned two 2024 International Design Excellence Awards (IDEA): a Bronze award in the Medical &amp; Health category and the People’s Choice award. Recognized for its exceptional design and innovation, Xpedition was celebrated for enhancing safety, efficiency and the user experience in emergency medical situations.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The Xpedition powered stair chair is purpose-built to meet the unique needs of EMS teams. Its powered track system is designed to help reduce the physical strain on responders, while its ergonomic design and durable materials help ensure a smooth, secure experience for both patients and caregivers. Whether in high-pressure emergency scenarios or routine patient transport, Xpedition is designed to provide confidence and control every step of the way.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Our goal is to deliver solutions that simplify the demanding work of EMS professionals, and the Xpedition stair chair reflects that commitment. As one of the few powered stair chairs in the industry, Xpedition builds on Stryker’s reputation for delivering innovative tools for emergency care. This recognition reaffirms our dedication to creating solutions that help EMS professionals do what they do best—care for others.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Curious how the Xpedition powered stair chair can support your team? <a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/emergency-care/products/xpedition-powered-stair-chair.html\">Learn more here</a>.</span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Sat Jan 11 2025 14:00:00 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
